15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Mio, fair point. @Victoria, the statements will show the swing. Let’s not over-engineer this.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: I just want to know if this is a five-minute task or a five-hour one.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: I would prefer to verify if the current split actually matches our individual usage patterns.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: Agreed. I need to see the full year's figures before I commit to any new structure.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I just want us to stop feeling awkward about asking for money.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,- **Benjamin**: Agreed. Let’s look at the data. I’ll check the statements and the payment log.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
