35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: The statements show February at 29,400 yen and August at 9,100. No two months are close.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: That swing is huge. I hope the template doesn't make it worse.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The rooms are not equal. Two need heat from November, the others stay warm until December.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room for meters. That is a significant upfront cost for us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: It took three weeks to settle the newcomers' bills, and part was just written off. That felt really unfair.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: And the payment log shows three months settled late, always after someone questioned the amount.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Benjamin, that explains the awkwardness. @Minato, I saw the other house spent forty minutes just logging readings.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: So the rooms were handed out by lot, not by need. That explains the heating gap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: Thirty-four thousand per room is steep. I need to know if the savings justify that upfront hit.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Mio, forty minutes? I worry that time spent on numbers is time we don’t spend talking to each other.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: The late payments correlate with the confusion. If the split is opaque, trust erodes. We need clarity, not just speed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Benjamin, clarity is good, but if it takes hours, I’m out. I need a system that doesn’t eat my evenings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The lot system was arbitrary. If we keep it, we are ignoring the physical reality of the rooms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: The upfront cost is high, but the seasonal swing is too wild to ignore. I need to see how a fixed rate handles that.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: I just want us to feel safe asking for money again, without the awkward silence afterwards.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: The data is in. We have a massive seasonal swing, unequal rooms, and a high upfront cost for meters. Let’s discuss options.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: I’m ready to hear the options, but please keep the monthly workload in mind.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: I am listening. I want a method that reflects reality, not just a number that is easy to calculate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: I am listening, but I need to know if the upfront cost is worth the peace of mind.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I’m listening too. I just hope whatever we pick doesn’t make us feel like strangers again.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
